<![CDATA[<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Hi </span></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;">{!Lead.FirstName}</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;">,</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Greetings of the day.</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Organizations today generate more data than ever, but the real challenge is </span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:700">turning that data into decisions</span></span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">. The gap between collecting information and extracting value can define success or failure.</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">At </span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:700">Techwish Technologies</span></span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">, we help enterprises leverage </span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:700">Data &amp; AI Services</span></span></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"> to:</span></span></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 1